<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97823" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύγ-κλητος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>called together,
			summoned</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στράτευμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>IA</u>
					301
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύγκλητον τήνδε γερόντων . . λέσχην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					160
				</span></i>
			 (anap.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ς</span>. <i>invited
				guests</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				6.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ἐκκλησία</span> at Athens, an assembly
				<i>specially summoned</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυρία</span>, Decr. ap. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.37
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				73
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.945.5
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύγκλητος</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βουλή</span>), ἡ, <i>summoned council</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκκλησία</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1275b8
			</span></i>; at Carthage, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				10.18.1
			</span></i>; in the Achaean League, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				29.24.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				7.411.13
			</span></i> (Oropus, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>); freq. of the Roman
				<u>Senate</u>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				21.1.3
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				3.4.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				4.83
			</span></i>, etc., and in Inscrr., as <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				591.68
			</span></i> (Lampsacus, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				785.12
			</span></i> (Chios, <span class="entity">i A.D.</span>), etc.; personified, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεὸς</span></div>
